\begin{bmatrix}x(u,v,w) \\\\ y(u,v,w) \\\\ z(u,v,w)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w}\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =- 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =- 4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} & =4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} & =3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & =- \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & =u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}- 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(- \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}- 4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix}+\\left(u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+2}\\begin{vmatrix}- 4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ 3 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & 3 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right)+\\left(12 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)+\\left(12 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right) \\\\  & =12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\left(\\cos^2 v+\\sin^2 v\\right) \\\\  & =12 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538089 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538075} {:answer/id #uuid "4b164324-6818-54e6-8c89-068adf9f97cb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538078} {:answer/id #uuid "93f201c2-2807-52fc-8eb4-d528a5a92114" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538087} {:answer/id #uuid "cb9ed056-0f15-5af6-bf97-d96d493b309a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538098} {:answer/id #uuid "d8b8d957-d16d-59c3-b069-322a9e119da0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538102}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "132328d8-571d-54c1-a382-e07fe4ab0e8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538075} :answer-field/id #uuid "b9788c2a-17e2-5bc6-b3b2-10eb15534e45" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538095}] :question/difficulty {:db/ident :question.difficulty/hard} :question/id #uuid "a098c802-39d1-511b-a349-0ab807ea00b6" :question/problem "Find the Jacobian determinant of the transformation $T$ that maps the $uvw$-space into the $xyz$-space by means of the equations\n\n$$\nx=4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\, y=u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)}\\, z=- 2 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "For a transformation \n\n$$\nT:\\begin{bmatrix}u \\\\ v \\\\ w\\end{bmatrix}\\to \\begin{bmatrix}x(u,v,w) \\\\ y(u,v,w) \\\\ z(u,v,w)\\end{bmatrix},\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w}\\end{vmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂x}{∂w} & =- 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =\\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂y}{∂w} & =u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\frac{∂z}{∂u} & =- 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂v} & =2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & \\frac{∂z}{∂w} & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y,z)}{∂(u,v,w)} & =\\begin{vmatrix}4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & 4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ - 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & 2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} & 0\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(- 2 \\cos{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+1}\\begin{vmatrix}4 u \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ u \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\cos{\\left(v \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix}+\\left(2 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)(-1)^{3+2}\\begin{vmatrix}4 \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)} & - 4 u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} \\\\ \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\sin{\\left(w \\right)} & u \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos{\\left(w \\right)}\\end{vmatrix} \\\\  & =\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right)+\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)\\left(\\cos^2 w+\\sin^2 w\\right) \\\\  & =\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)} \\cos^{2}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right)+\\left(- 8 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}\\right) \\\\  & =- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}\\left(\\cos^2 v+\\sin^2 v\\right) \\\\  & =- 8 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186538091 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02cc8b0b-3b33-504e-9fcf-49fefb81af1f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36 u^{2} \\sin^{3}{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538072} {:answer/id #uuid "0e1688fd-9312-57f7-9c64-e1d3ad42a239" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "- 36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186538074} {:answer/id #uuid "cbd03066-c83d-5019-9485-37cb3cc2441b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "36 u^{2} \\sin{\\left(v \\right)}" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218653809